# Twisted Sewer-Witch (3/4): "create a 1/1 black Rat with 'This creature can't block.' Then for each Rat you control, create a Wicked Role
# token attached to that Rat." Bot1 casts it on turn 3 with no other Rat: exactly one Rat, one Wicked Role (+1/+1: the Rat is 2/2); the Witch
# (not a Rat) gets none. On turn 4 Bot2's Grizzly Bears attacks: the Rat can't block (refused), the Witch can. On turn 5 Bot1 Bolts its
# own Rat: the Wicked Role goes to the graveyard and each opponent loses 1 life (20 -> 19).

